    <summary>A WinUI 3 app to view, create, run, snooze and manage the tasks of the Windows Task Scheduler.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
FluentTaskScheduler is a WinUI 3 app for the tasks of the Windows Task Scheduler. It lists all tasks
with their state and next run, and lets you create, edit, run, stop, enable, disable, move, delete,
export and import them. It shows each task's history from the Task Scheduler event log and a
dashboard of the runs of the last seven days. You can snooze all tasks or a single task, start other
tasks when a task succeeds or fails, and create tasks from built-in templates and your own
PowerShell scripts. A command line lists tasks as JSON, starts, enables and disables tasks, and
exports a task's history as CSV.

**Requirements:** Windows 10 version 1809 (build 17763) or later, x64 or ARM64.
    ]]></description>
    <tags>task-scheduler automation windows winui3 fluent productivity admin</tags>
